<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 20 0 R/E(Cretum Capital Partners is an independent firm founded in 2014 and headquartered in Mexico City, specializing in financial asset investment with a focus on capital preservation, liquidity, and consistent returns. It manages over USD $2.8 billion in public and private markets, including hedge and private credit strategies, and serves institutional and high-net-worth clients such as governments, pension funds, high-net-worth individuals, and family offices.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

