29 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 20 0 R/E(Cretum Partners' GVV \(Growth, Value & Volatility\) investment model combines various strategies to maximize returns and manage risks. It focuses on companies with high growth potential \(growth\) and undervalued assets \(value\), complemented by hedges against volatility through models like Black-Scholes \(volatility\). It maintains high liquidity to take advantage of market opportunities and relies on quantitative analysis with Machine Learning to strengthen decision-making and risk control. Additionally, it includes investments in fixed income, options strategies, dividends, and long and short positions, aiming for effective portfolio immunization.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

